description: End lengthy replies with a separator line, then a short paragraph summarizing the discussion
alwaysApply: true
---

# Response Summary

End every lengthy reply with one short paragraph that summarizes the
discussion: what was asked, what was decided or done, and what is still open.

Put a markdown separator line (`---`) between the response and that summary
paragraph.

Skip the summary on short replies (a yes/no, a single fact, or a brief
approval wait). Do not use a bullet list or a heading for it; one paragraph
at the end is enough.
